# Local settings for the counter (functions/): TEMPLATE, no values.
# Copy this file to .dev.vars (same folder) and fill in the value.
# .dev.vars is not committed (.gitignore).
#
# In production the same name is set in the Cloudflare Pages dashboard:
#   Workers & Pages > project > Settings > Variables and Secrets > Add > Encrypt.
# The database binding (DB) is not a variable: Settings > Bindings.

# Key for GET /api/summary (SECRET). At least 24 characters; with a shorter
# value the summary stays closed (403). Make your own and share it with no one:
#   node -e "console.log(require('node:crypto').randomBytes(24).toString('base64url'))"
SUMMARY_KEY=
